    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐώρα</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰώρα</span>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.Dion.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				23
			</span></i>: pl., of a festival in honour of Erigone, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				515
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰ</span>- codd.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐωρέω</span></b> , 
