			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, Dosith.<i><span class="en">
				p.431
			</span></i> K. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐώρημα</span></b> , 
				=
